    "text": "SPORTSBoston Marathon 2026: All 90 Seacoast runners with fastest, oldest, youngest Jay PinsonnaultPortsmouth HeraldUpdated April 12, 2026, 2:33 p.m. ETThere are 90 runners from Seacoast New Hampshire and southern York County, Maine, scheduled to compete in the 130th running of the Boston Marathon on Monday, April 20.From the youngest Seacoast runner, Cooper Miller, 19, of Greenland, to the oldest, Thomas Adler, 74, of Kennebunkport, Maine, these runners are part of the more than 30,000 in the 2026 field expected to make the 26.2-mile trek from Hopkinton to Copley Square.",
